  "intermediate_failures": [
    "A 100-cycle filter-only pass did not establish correctness: artificial callback delay and a stalled client exposed the second race.",
    "A generic Clutter event filter did not observe events already consumed for application dispatch; replaced with InputMethod filtering/forwarding observation.",
    "An intermediate Xwayland state comparison failed without first confirming the GUI sample reached the preceding resize; the fixture now awaits client geometry before comparing.",
    "An unconditional success assertion after single-line Return failed; the final regression checks a bounded pre-edit refusal and records this limitation instead of pretending the client confirmed."
  ],
